sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Specs as /specs (orchestrator)
    participant PM as Product Manager
    participant Arch as Architect
    participant Plan as /plan (orchestrator)
    participant Critics as plan-review-* critics

    User->>Specs: /specs "feature description"
    Specs->>Specs: Select mode, check for an existing spec version

    rect rgb(239, 246, 255)
        note over User,PM: Intent Description
        User->>PM: Draft intent
        PM->>PM: Screen decision-defaults axes
        PM-->>User: Critique: gaps, ambiguities, conflicts, scope
        User-->>PM: Accept / reject / modify (with reasons)
        PM-->>User: Refined intent (max 2 rounds)
    end

    rect rgb(239, 246, 255)
        note over User,Arch: Architecture Specification
        User->>Arch: Draft architecture notes
        Arch-->>User: Critique
        User-->>Arch: Decide
        Arch-->>User: Refined architecture notes
    end

    rect rgb(239, 246, 255)
        note over User,PM: Acceptance Criteria
        Specs->>Specs: Ambiguity Resolution Protocol on every gap
        Specs-->>User: "Before writing acceptance criteria, I need N decisions: [list]"
        User-->>Specs: Answers
        User->>PM: Draft acceptance criteria
        PM-->>User: Critique, then refine
        Specs->>Specs: Completeness sweep, Ambiguity Log, Glossary
    end

    Specs->>Arch: Run cross-artifact consistency gate
    alt gate fails
        Arch-->>User: Failing items, loop continues
    else gate passes
        Arch-->>Specs: Pass
        Specs->>Specs: Persist (docs/specs file or GitHub epic issue)
        Specs->>Plan: Auto-invoke /plan (authoring mode only)
    end

    Plan->>Plan: Read spec, cut vertical slices, author Gherkin per slice
    Plan->>Plan: plan_waves.py derives waves, classify plan tier
    Plan->>Critics: Dispatch tier-scaled reviewer set in parallel
    Critics-->>Plan: approve / needs-revision with issues
    loop until all approve (max 2)
        Plan->>Plan: Revise plan
        Plan->>Critics: Re-run flagged critics
    end
    Plan-->>User: Plan + Plan Review Summary. "Approve, or suggest changes?"
    alt changes requested
        User-->>Plan: Changes
        Plan-->>User: Revised plan
    else approved
        User-->>Plan: Approve
        Plan->>Plan: Mark approved, export .feature files, offer slice issues
        Plan-->>User: Ready for /build
    end
